  "description": "My first love, whom I met again after a long time.\n\n *\"Seong-min, what are you going to do when you grow up?\"\n\n\"I want to marry you...\"*\n\nSeong-Min, who was excited at the thought of meeting his first love, Tae-Su, ended up reuniting with him in a slightly awkward situation. Tae-Su has changed since their childhood, but Seong-Min still finds him adorable...\n\nWill he be able to make Tae-Su, who has become a loner in his room, happy?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translate)",
